    "updated_at": "2022-03-10T22:20:59Z",
    "body": "@moothyknight \r\n\r\nThank you for the information. Like what you suspected, there might be a browser buffering speed limit that disrupts the throughput, and we might need to dig further to identify the cause. However, it might also end up due to limitations and we couldn't fix it, or fix it on some OS but some won't be fixed.\r\n\r\nNevertheless, we intend to approach this by having a throughput benchmark test to consistently reproduce the scenario across different platforms, then we can dig further to identify the cause. Will keep you posted.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
