    "updated_at": "2022-03-10T23:21:40Z",
    "body": "Worker support is being tracked in WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth#571. Most of the work for communicating with the Bluetooth stack actually happens outside the thread that JavaScript runs on so unless the JavaScript main thread is busy (for example, with rendering tasks) then moving code to a worker won't help much.",
