    "body": "@reillyeon ah good to know! I've been pushing every limit I can think of with workers and device throughput rates etc. I'm excited how much work is going into optimization on browsers, really has me looking forward to application development. We are working on real time EEG and EMG analysis applications in-browser using threaded gpu workers and stuff to handle signal processing, just trying to make sure devices are stable over BLE 5 for our new boards which have insane throughput and range with little power usage. ",
